# Generated search-index builds — regenerated locally on every environment
# by `python web/services/data_processing.py`; never checked into git
# (avoids committing a manifest.json/active_build.txt that points at
# build artifacts a fresh clone won't have).
web/processed_data/

# Impeccable design tooling.
# Tracked deliberately (shared, team-wide state — do NOT ignore the directory):
#   .impeccable/design.json       design-system sidecar, the companion to DESIGN.md
#   .impeccable/config.json       detector config, incl. reviewed rule exceptions
#   .impeccable/live/config.json  live-mode inject targets and the CSP-checked flag
# Everything below is per-machine runtime state, regenerated on demand.
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/live/roots.json
.impeccable/live/inject-journal.json
.impeccable/live/sessions/

